Package: zurandpract
Version: 0.0.1
Title: Test Fixture Running 'zurand' Streams Through 'zurngtest'
Description: Built by tests/testthat/test-zurngtest.R to test a 'zurand'
    stream with 'PractRand' through the C callable of 'zurngtest', the way
    a generator package written in C would. It gets both headers' paths
    from the test, so 'zurngtest' is not a dependency of 'zurand'.
